  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Prakash Khuntia @ Prakash vs State Of Odisha ... Opposite Party on 25 November, 2025 Author: G. Satapathy Bench: G. Satapathy In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Blapl No. 10338 of 2025 Prakash Khuntia @ Prakash ... Petitioner Chandra Khantia Mr. J.K. Panda, Advocate -versus- State of Odisha ... Opposite Party Mr. A. Pradhan, Addl.",
    "facts": "2. This is an application U/S.483 of BNSS by the petitioner for grant of bail in connection with CT Case No. 630 of 2025 arising out of Gurudijhatia PS Case No. 171 of 2025 pending in the file of learned SDJM, Athagarh for commission of offences punishable Under Sections 274/318(4)/318(2)/316(3)/3(5) of BNS and Sections 51 and 59 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (in short \"the Act\"), on the main allegation of adulterating milk rendering it unfit for human consumption.",
    "arguments": "On being queried about the criminal antecedent of the petitioner, Mr. Panda volunteers to withhold bail to the petitioner, if he is found to have any criminal antecedents of similar nature for commission of offence under Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 4.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "On being queried about the criminal antecedent of the petitioner, Mr. Panda volunteers to withhold bail to the petitioner, if he is found to have any criminal antecedents of similar nature for commission of offence under Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 4.",
